ndex":6,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":884542,"width":1885,"height":1648,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/Finally%2C_a_good_pic_of_the_iPod_shuffle_mod_%2896348192%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Finally,_a_good_pic_of_the_iPod_shuffle_mod_(96348192).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=3301249","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2007-12-30 11:47:44","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Finally, a good pic of the iPod shuffle mod (96348192)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Taken with Fujifilm FinePix A360|NES Controller|Flickr images reviewed by File Upload Bot (Magnus Manske)|IPod shuffle (1st generation)","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>So here the beast is. Dave did an outstanding job.  New photo, now with 30% less blur!\n</p><p>A brief description of the controls: \nUp/Down: Volume up/down\nRight/Left: Track forward/backward\nSelect: contains a 3-way switch for continuous play, shuffle play, and off\nStart: contains a switch for hold\nA Button: play/pause\nB Button: absolutely nothing!\n</p><p>The only external parts of the controller that Dave modified were the start/select buttons, which now contain small switches instead of the original rubber buttons, and a cut on the right side of the controller for the USB port. We chose to place a female USB port in there.\n</p>\nThis thing looks great, and works beautifully - I get loads of questions about it on the street from all sorts of people.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2006-02-02 06:25","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/25096649@N00/96348192/\">finally, a good pic of the iPod shuffle mod</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/25096649@N00\">Colin Ashe</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-2.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"112460213":{"pageid":112460213,"ns":6,"title":"File:First generation I iPod Shuffle in its packaging.jpg","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":378940,"width":1453,"height":1502,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/First_generation_I_iPod_Shuffle_in_its_packaging.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:First_generation_I_iPod_Shuffle_in_its_packaging.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=112460213","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2021-11-12 19:16:12","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"First generation I iPod Shuffle in its packaging","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Apple Inc. in-ear headphones|Self-published work|IPod shuffle (1st generation)|Photographs by Edmunddantes","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hid